    "detailed_description": "<h1>Black Vultures Coming Soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/54f0677dfc6c49e9db00a4fa5b9ef737.avif?t=1753682691\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension of realistic battlefields with engaging environmental elements and authentic, modern firearms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Independent Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and size up your enemy in the battle of wits. Which of the three teams will secure the cargo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life Ticket Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a ticket? Jump back into the fight anytime. Don't give up, keep at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Heads up! Strategically adapt your play style based on your remaining tickets to manage combat effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cargo Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure the cargo to claim your team's hard-earned loot. Fail, and you'll get nothing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team-Based Farming System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win and claim loot with your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's in those boxes? The mystery of loot boxes await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize equipment to your liking. Pick and choose the barrel, handle, magazine, sight, stock, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the full range of customization options to create your perfect loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension of realistic battlefields with engaging environmental elements and authentic, modern firearms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/9a13516692322fe71ba22d02f261891b.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Independent Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in and size up your enemy in the battle of wits. Which of the three teams will secure the cargo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/eb3d8ffdf2986feb79c053fb2f7f8255.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life Ticket Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a ticket? Jump back into the fight anytime. Don't give up, keep at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Heads up! Strategically adapt your play style based on your remaining tickets to manage combat effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/6cd64c303d3d9c6e1e37a1fdd7c49932.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cargo Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure the cargo to claim your team's hard-earned loot. Fail, and you'll get nothing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/5e490c15b7bbac2523fa05d8480b3bad.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team-Based Farming System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win and claim loot with your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's in those boxes? The mystery of loot boxes await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/fa5e13ed3702511fd171bba640d69e5d.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize equipment to your liking. Pick and choose the barrel, handle, magazine, sight, stock, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the full range of customization options to create your perfect loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.poster.avif?t=1753682691\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.webm?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/aab7f77ca2e2878fbe515715e3745b80.mp4?t=1753682691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
